<title>UK: TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF KIEFER V KAFELNIKOV.</title>
<headline>TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF KIEFER V KAFELNIKOV.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics of the fourth round</p>
<p>match between Germany's Nicolas Kiefer and Russia's Yevgeny</p>
<p>Kafelnikov at Wimbledon on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Kiefer won 6-2 7-5 2-6 6-1</p>
<p>Time: Two hours five minutes</p>
<p>KIEFER	   KAFELNIKOV</p>
<p>Aces				   12		   8</p>
<p>Double faults			 8		  11</p>
<p>Percentage first serves in     48		  50</p>
<p>Percentage unreturned serves   34		  28</p>
<p>Forehand winners		   34		  38</p>
<p>Backhand winners		   39		  23</p>
<p>Volley winners			8		  12</p>
<p>Passing winners		    11		   4</p>
<p>Return winners			6		   0</p>
<p>Percentage returns in	    72		  66</p>
<p>Break points			 14		  11</p>
<p>Break points won		    6		   3</p>
</text>
